    "title": "Plans to Expand Historic German Village Restaurant Approved - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ashley Kimmel ,\n8 hours ago The new owner of The Old Mohawk has received partial approval to alter the historic German Village establishment. An application to expand and renovate The Old Mohawk, located at 819 Mohawk St., was presented to the German Village Commission earlier this month. The panel approved part of the proposal needed to move forward and requested the applicant return with updated details for further approval. Read full article\n1",
